# Ship flight architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/ship-flight.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/ship-flight.md).

**Permanent decision:** flying hull is a **Rapier** rigid body; **flight computer** emits
forces/torques (dual-reticle aim, coupled/decoupled, boost). **Atmospheric
gravity** from planet `gravityMetersPerSecond2` inside
`atmosphereHeightMeters` (heavier *g* → harder/longer escape); vacuum = no
planet pull. Modes: **Traverse** / **Combat** / **Nav** (`tap U`); quantum only
from **Nav**. Cruise max = `maxSpeedMps`; boost raises thrust demand + velocity
cap. Parked deck stays ship-local Rapier — do not dual-drive pose. Open Space /
Warp Gates: [Space traversal](../../docs/docs/architecture/space-traversal.md).

When changing flight physics, atmospheric gravity, flight computer, modes,
boost/speed, quantum, or contacts, read the full doc first. Also listed in
`AGENTS.md`.
